    "custom": "---\n---\n# Location Details — Aerfála Custom\n\nWhen generating location details, lean into the anime-fantasy aesthetic:\n\n- Towns have a Guild branch, a tavern with a memorable name, and at least one local specialty (food, craft, or attraction)\n- Cities have districts with distinct character — market, temple, pleasure, residential, craft, military\n- Dungeons have a theme, a ranking, and a boss room with treasure worth the risk\n- Hot springs and bathhouses are present in every region and function as social/recovery/romantic spaces\n- Wilderness locations have a specific danger and a specific beauty\n- Every location has at least one secret — hidden basement, sealed door, underground passage, or local legend that turns out to be true\n- Describe locations with sensory detail: the smell of forge-smoke in Ironhold, the sound of wind through the World-Tree, the taste of salt air in Tidewatch"
